      <activity id="f3699485-e25c-5ba1-877a-2e57d905276a" activityNameId="7318fc3a-2856-55ff-8fe1-76afad8e45a5" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">xxx Operation, passenger car, diesel, fleet average</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: xxx Operation, passenger car, diesel, fleet average
Average data for the operation of an average diesel passenger car (fleet average) Switzerland in the year 2005, comprising various emission technologies.;
UUID: 43ff82e2-400a-3664-9d06-144428fbd9c1
Fuel consumption is included. Direct airborne emissions of gaseous substances, particulate matters and heavy metals are accounted for. Particulate emissions comprise exhaust- and abrasions emissions.  Heavy metal emissions to soil and water caused by tyre abrasion are included.
Location: &lt;null&gt;
Technology: diesel engine including various emission standards
Time period: undefined
Production volume: 8915 Mio.vkm/a
Sampling: Literature data. 
Extrapolations: none
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_43ff82e2-400a-3664-9d06-144428fbd9c1.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
